  "body": "## Changelog\n### Bug fixes\n* 9e70b42b384b0b23475138f5fe90338babb73eb5 fix(ci): bump mockery to v3.8.1 so go generate works on Go 1.27 (#109)\n* aab9b933da87d1a57d46cdafb20b90ba22545714 fix: reorder few lines to properly handle error (#97)\n### Misc\n* 2b09345bb187d9ce86f93589d59a0fe96bd2c5a0 chore(ci): run staticcheck with the Go version from go.mod (#105)\n* a597efe4bfc30be68d710b3669ffa8ea18029764 feat: add graphic_scale setting to render emotes/badges multiple rows high (#104)\n* c43c12d5758fe8597d39567d3a252cd941900808 feat: reply to chat messages (#106)\n* 22a79e4faa7cb6d06f56a773aa925b191d15e0ad fix Fixing emote rendering issue (#99)\n* b8c3d4cddb12aa9163cd0ec034b0b5a8deb50c51 refactor: break up broadcast_tab.go and extract chatInput + reply modules (#107)\n\n",
